<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Welcome to My Website</title>

    <style>
        body {
            background-color: lightblue;
            font-family: Cambria, serif;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: blue;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        h1 {
            color: blue;
        }

        /* Scrolling Text */
        .scroll-container {
            width: 100%;
            overflow: hidden;
            white-space: nowrap;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        .scroll-text {
            display: inline-block;
            padding-left: 100%;
            animation: scroll 10s linear infinite;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: blue;
        }

        @keyframes scroll {
            from {
                transform: translateX(0);
            }
            to {
                transform: translateX(-100%);
            }
        }

        /* Grid Layout */
        .grid-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 150px);
            gap: 15px;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .grid-item {
            background-color: white;
            border: 2px solid blue;
            padding: 20px;
            color: blue;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        /* Button */
        button {
            background-color: blue;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-family: Cambria, serif;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        button:hover {
            background-color: darkblue;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <h1>Welcome to My Website</h1>

    <div class="scroll-container">
        <div class="scroll-text">
            ★ Welcome to My Website ★ Learn HTML, CSS and Web Design ★
        </div>
    </div>

    <p>This is a simple webpage created using HTML and CSS.</p>

    <button>Click Here</button>

    <div class="grid-container">
        <div class="grid-item">Box 1</div>
        <div class="grid-item">Box 2</div>
        <div class="grid-item">Box 3</div>
        <div class="grid-item">Box 4</div>
        <div class="grid-item">Box 5</div>
        <div class="grid-item">Box 6</div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
